<title>NETHERLANDS: NEDCON H1 NET FALLS. [CORRECTED 15:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>NEDCON H1 NET FALLS. [CORRECTED 15:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>DOETINCHEM, Netherlands 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Nedcon corrects 1996 first-half net profit per share to 0.99 guilders from 1.05 guilders)</p>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.99 vs   1.20</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.3  vs   1.6</p>
<p>    Turnover				52.2  vs  41.1</p>
<p>    Order book total		    63.7  vs  41.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Warehouse equipment maker Nedcon Groep NV said it</p>
<p>expected the 1996 second-half net profit to be at least equal to</p>
<p>this year's first-half net. Last year it suffered a full-year</p>
<p>loss of 0.7 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
